<title>POLAND: DOM PLAST MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>DOM PLAST MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.43 vs   1.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.66 vs   1.81</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.82 vs   1.67</p>
<p> Sales		    7.01 vs   5.66</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.70 vs   3.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.84 vs   5.35</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.14 vs   5.19</p>
<p> Sales		   20.27 vs  18.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastic houseware maker is Dom</p>
<p>Plast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
